Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 14:32:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] custody-canary-proof: hash-only canary app for the
 release-16c2999d per-app tier

Reads only CANARY_[A-Z0-9_]{1,40} environment variables (staged custody secrets reach the
component as --env NAME=VALUE on release-16c2999d, custody/front-prod 837c0061d), at most 8,
and answers HMAC-SHA256 proofs over a fresh challenge for driver-format high-entropy markers
only. No ENCLAVE_CONFIG, logs, echo, values, lengths or outbound network.

Component sha256 7ce32918 (101222 B), CIDv1 bafkreid44murq..., reproduced 3x offline with the
cached toolchain and the hello-world p2 wasi pins. Queue: unit 6/6, mutants 9/9, release
wasmtime HTTP smoke 23/23. Binary untracked; publish/admission prerequisites in README.
